<h2>How to add a submenu</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Create a <code>.links.menu.yml</code> entry in your custom module with parent <code>bm_main.bluemarloc_admin</code>.</li>
  <li>Provide a route in <code>.routing.yml</code> that points to your form or controller.</li>
  <li>Clear caches with <code>drush cr</code>.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Tips</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Use <code>weight</code> to control order.</li>
  <li>Pick the right subsection for clarity.</li>
</ul>
